MATH_0009": "$L$", "MATH_0010": "$M$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Z} \\mathcal{Y} \\to\n\\mathcal{A} \\times_\\mathcal{C} \\mathcal{B}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-functoriality-2-fibre-product}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0007": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7c2c727c5815924c3cad9e83715fff0ec7614027d4c41b7840cdae19ac60f459", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1676ae4e4a0f9f945d5ca4d0573e3d5bbc5ed8e78925bf9af1ddb93cc799e89c", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nAssumptions as in Lemma <REF_0001>.\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> are faithful\nthen the morphism\n<MATH_0003>\nis faithful.\n<STRUCT_0004> If <MATH_0004> and <MATH_0005> are fully faithful and <MATH_0006> is faithful\nthen the morphism\n<MATH_0007>\nis fully faithful.\n<STRUCT_0005> If <MATH_0008> and <MATH_0009> are equivalences and <MATH_0010> is fully faithful\nthen the morphism\n<MATH_0011>\nis an equivalence.\n<STRUCT_0006>\n<STRUCT_0007>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6ac7bb3b1b6201130bf517deac47bd305a0b1076bf33df491aa72185713266dd", "unit_id": "inventory:categories:02XB:lemma/0001"}, "state": "READY"}, "reference:categories-lemma-equivalence-fibred-categories": {"context_hash": "sha256:c28bed6700faa3083c6c6cfaf46c3330abe1a4290183e2034f45b794c376b835", "kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 258032, "byte_start": 257359, "file": "categories.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:1dbcba72f7f62cf0b2f1e4111e7afd5ec0ed7ccb8ab60b1413ab8ea0e3162b0a", "line_end": 7284, "line_start": 7270}, "owner_tag": "003Z", "parent_tag": "003S", "requested_label": "categories-lemma-equivalence-fibred-categories", "r