034>。最后，若图表（diagram）交换（commutes），则<MATH_0035>对所有<MATH_0036>都是恒等（identity），并可见此<MATH_0037>-态射（morphism）是<MATH_0038>-态射（morphism），它在<MATH_0039>-范畴（category）中，该范畴由<MATH_0040>上的范畴（categories）构成。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:1acbbea2d9a4554d2d8302e5d94c2be644f7f7bf747d972c67a8cfa71fe46baa", "unit_id": "tag:06N8:proof", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "两个范畴与同一纤维积的比较；待决。", "source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"context": "共同的比较范畴；待决。", "source_term": "category fibred in groupoids", "target_term": "群胚纤维化范畴"}, {"context": "选择的拟逆；待决。", "source_term": "quasi-inverse", "target_term": "拟逆"}, {"context": "带阶数限定的高阶范畴；待决。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "基底上范畴；待决。", "source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "给定比较图表；待决。", "source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"context": "带阶数限定的交换性；待决。", "source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换的"}, {"context": "带阶数限定的态射；待决。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "同构的端点；待决。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "构造比较态射的泛性质；待决。", "source_term": "universal property", "target_term": "泛性质"}, {"context": "带阶数限定的纤维积；待决。", "source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"context": "比较态射的等价性质；待决。", "source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价"}, {"context": "高阶范畴中对象的纤维化条件；待决。", "source_term": "fibred", "target_term": "纤维化"}, {"context": "纤维化的群胚条件；待决。", "source_term": "groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"context": "需构造的高阶同构及函子性的同构；待决。", "source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "选定的两个高阶同构；待决。", "source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "第一因子的显式构造；待决。", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "比较函子的对象作用；待决。", "source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "所构造同构的函子性；待决。", "source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性的"}, {"context": "严格交换条件；待决。", "source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"context": "严格交换时的变换分量；待决。", "source_term